      "content": "hey my 14yo son was just told by his doctor he has anemia and needs to take iron. i bought these 325mg tablets but i saw online that sometimes people take more to get better faster. since he's a growing teen and clearly needs it, would it be okay to give him two of those a day instead of just one to help him bounce back quicker?",
